    "alt": "在溫馨明亮的臥室裡，小男孩和媽媽一起彎腰把木質地板上的積木與玩具車收進玩具箱，床鋪也整理得整整齊齊。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo looks around his "
        },
        {
          "text": "bedroom",
          "wordIds": [
            "bedroom"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look at this mess.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "look-at-this-mess"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 看著自己的臥室並說：「看這團亂七八糟。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Many blocks and "
        },
        {
          "text": "toy",
          "wordIds": [
            "toy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " cars are all over the "
        },
        {
          "text": "floor",
          "wordIds": [
            "floor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "好多積木和玩具車散落得整座地板都是。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mom smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Let's put the toys away.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "lets-put-the-toys-away"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "媽媽微笑著說：「我們把玩具收好吧。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo picks up a "
        },
        {
          "text": "toy",
          "wordIds": [
            "toy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " car, and Mom says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Put it in the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-it-in-the-box"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "box",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-it-in-the-box"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "box"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "put-it-in-the-box"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 撿起一輛玩具車，媽媽說：「把它放進箱子裡。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They put every "
        },
        {
          "text": "toy",
          "wordIds": [
            "toy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " into the "
        },
        {
          "text": "box",
          "wordIds": [
            "box"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and make the "
        },
        {
          "text": "bed",
          "wordIds": [
            "bed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們把每個玩具都放進箱子裡，並把床鋪整理好。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo looks at his tidy room and smiles, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Now it is ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "now-it-is-clean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "clean",
          "phraseIds": [
            "now-it-is-clean"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "clean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "now-it-is-clean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 看著整齊的房間微笑著說：「現在變乾淨了。」"
    }
  ],
